      "kind": "text",
      "id": "question",
      "title": "Question and scope",
      "body": "This study asks whether a one-bar pullback, an extended-run reversal, or a quiet-period breakout improves signed chart-price paths on ES 6RXV, NQ 20RXV and GC 20RXV. The selected run executed corrected protocol 1.0.1 on the pinned pre-normalization exports."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "findings",
      "title": "Supported findings",
      "body": "No primary idea-by-product comparison passes the declared screen. The selected all-history means below retain adverse tails and unsuccessful contrasts. Favorable point differences do not establish a candidate when uncertainty and later-block requirements fail."
